sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch05-20> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch05-20--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch05-20--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch05-20: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.50" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.502"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "partially-resolvable" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.6"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Shell archives are good enough to test whether flask-shaped Lagena are surfaces of revolution and winged forms are not. The claim itself is about orientation during formation, and that life-position variable is not in those collections. Shape is a usable proxy with a serious confound, so only part of the claim can be resolved now." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Fit Lagena tests to a surface of revolution and compare that symmetry class with any records of orientation during calcification. Unduloids formed while the axis is vertical, and winged tests formed while it is horizontal, would support the claim; the reverse pairing would refute it." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Public images record finished tests, not the posture of the living cell while the shell was secreted.", "An unduloid of revolution is also the expected outcome of any axisymmetric growth rule, so shape alone does not identify a hanging-drop posture." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch05-20--grok--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch05-20--grok--dataset-2> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch05-20--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of thompson1917-ch05-20 by Grok 4.7: 0.7" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.7"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch05-20--grok> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch05-20> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch05-20--grok--operationalizability> .
